    en: `Everything the law takes from a salary in Hong Kong for the 2026/27 tax year, from what your employer pays to what you can buy. Income tax is low and can never go above a fixed 15%. You and your employer each put 5% into a retirement fund (the MPF), up to a limit. There is no VAT.`,
